 "In First or Club World, please take care of your personal electronic device when adjusting your seat. If your device does get lost, please do not move the seat. Instead, please let a member of the crew know and we will be happy to assist you. Here at British Airways, our BA Better World Community Fund creates life-changing opportunities while supporting amazing projects and charities that align with our sustainability programme. Shortly, we will pause the in-flight entertainment to share a short video with you. If you would like to get involved, you can, right now, by simply donating any spare change in any currency into our charity collection bag, which a member of the crew will bring through the cabin soon. On behalf of all of our partners, we thank you in advance for your continued support and generosity.": "./audio/cards/ef7746cd6a2832ee26f8.mp3",
